			"notes": "### Important Notice:\n\n- This update was entirely done by @DaveyL2013\n- Due to local issues with running the babric instance of bta 7.3 (the game softlocks upon attempting to draw the loading screen), I have been unable to personally verify that everything works.\n- I have also been unable to locally build the jar (`libnative-platform-file-events.dylib` no longer runs on my system).\n  - This issue on it's own would make continued development a pain, as I would have to rely on github actions to test the mod, but paired with my inability to run babric I can't see myself being able to continue development on this mod for the near future.\n  - I am already aware of the root cause for both of these issues and have been working on rectifying it for quite a while, but it could end up taking many more months to complete (or weeks if things go unrealistically well).\n\n### Update Notes:\n\n- Updated to bta 7.3\n\n### Requirements:\n\n- BTA 7.3\n- halplibe >=5.2.4\n\n[Jar file was compiled with github actions.](https://github.com/FrostBird347/Worms-Eye-View/actions/runs/15293219181)"
